",{"children":"The current version of Studomate requires no sign-up. Projects and simulations are stored "}],["$","strong","1",{"children":"locally"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":" in "}],["$","strong","3",{"children":"files"}],["$","$1","4",{"children":". The user is responsible for backing up their files. No personal data is sent to external servers without explicit consent."}]]}]],[["$","$L18",null,{"variant":"h3","component":"h2","gutterBottom":true,"mt":3,"children":"4. Intellectual property"}],["$","$L18",null,{"textAlign":"justify","children":"All technical, graphical and conceptual content of Studomate (interface, engine, icons, structure) remains the property of its authors. Any reproduction, modification or distribution without written authorisation is prohibited. The user remains the owner of the projects and creations they develop on the platform."}]],[["$","$L18",null,{"variant":"h3","component":"h2","gutterBottom":true,"mt":3,"children":"5. Liability"}],["$","$L18",null,{"textAlign":"justify","children":"Studomate aims to make automated systems easier to understand. It is a teaching tool, not certified industrial software. No guarantee is given as to the absolute accuracy of the simulations, compatibility with real equipment or long-term data retention. Use of the application is at the user's sole responsibility."}]],[["$","$L18",null,{"variant":"h3","component":"h2","gutterBottom":true,"mt":3,"children":"6. Changes to the service"}],["$","$L18",null,{"textAlign":"justify","children":"Studomate is continuously evolving. Features may be changed, added or suspended without notice, in particular during testing or maintenance phases. The team strives to keep the service stable and transparent."}]],["$","$L18",null,{"variant":"h3","component":"h2","gutterBottom":true,"mt":3,"children":"7. Contact"}],["$","$L18",null,{"children":["For any question, suggestion or technical report:"," ",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/contact","children":"Get in touch."}]]}]]}]
